---
import InfoLayout from '../layouts/InfoLayout.astro';
---
<InfoLayout title="About" active="about">
  <a class="back-link" href="/">← Earthquakes</a>
  <div class="info-intro"><h1>About QuakeStrike PH</h1><p>Understand recent earthquakes and forecasts in one place.</p></div>
  <div class="info-grid">
    <section class="info-card"><h2>Earthquake information</h2><p>The Bulletin is designed to show reconciled PHIVOLCS earthquake bulletins. Select an event in the list or on the map to inspect its time, magnitude, location, and depth.</p></section>
    <section class="info-card"><h2>What forecasts mean</h2><p>A forecast expresses probability over a stated period. It cannot tell you the exact time or place of a future earthquake. Forecast percentages will appear only after the model’s geographic area is confirmed.</p></section>
    <section class="info-card"><h2>Alerts</h2><p>Public earthquake information does not require an account. In the planned alert service, people will sign in only if they choose to receive and configure alerts.</p></section>
  </div>
  <p class="info-caution">For immediate safety guidance, follow <a href="https://www.phivolcs.dost.gov.ph/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PHIVOLCS</a> and your local authorities.</p>
</InfoLayout>
